<title>BELGIUM: EU clears Tyco/ADT deal.</title>
<headline>EU clears Tyco/ADT deal.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said on Friday it had cleared the acquisition by U.S. firm Tyco International of Bermuda-based electronics security firm ADT Ltd.</p>
<p>Both firms are active in the field of fire and security alarms in Europe and the United States.</p>
<p>&quot;Both of these sectors are currently growing sectors with a relatively fragmented supply structure,&quot; the Commission said in a statement. &quot;The combination of Tyco and ADT would not result in market shares exceeding 20 percent in any member state.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Brussels newsroom +32 2 287 68 11</p>
